  "summary": "The AcuRev 1320 exposes the same objects on BACnet IP and BACnet MS/TP: 61 read-only Analog Inputs (voltage, current, power, PF, unbalance, THD, demand, the independent channel 4 and the 'Sum2' summation), 38 Large Analog Value energy totals, three DI pulse counters and three DI status inputs.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet IP",
    "BACnet MS/TP"
  ],
  "firmware": "v1.01p21",
  "default_device_instance": null,
  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "DI pulse counters are Pulse Converter objects (listed as type Other).",
    "AI 33 / AI 58 load nature: 82 resistive, 76 inductive, 67 capacitive.",
    "Sum2 objects are a summation channel; channel 4 is the independent current input.",
    "Source: Accuenergy 'BACnet Points List AcuRev1320' spreadsheet, firmware v1.01p21, generated 2026-10-10."
  ],
